{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56602","headline":"秋晚感时寄裴草然 · 赵志","name":"秋晚感时寄裴草然","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰凋夏尽，菊荗秋深。\n惊□飋䫻，寒木萧森。\n天高月净，鸟思虫吟。\n感时怀友，望美沾襟。\n情唯丘壑，志在山林。\n从兹释纲，谢病抽簪。\n眷言鲍叔，知余此心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}